{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7663444194439268651","title":"软件产品经理（AG）-2027校招","description":"1、协助剪辑创作工具的产品需求整理与功能设计，参与竞品调研，整理功能对比与体验分析，参与版本迭代过程；\n2、基于用户创作流程，拆解使用路径与关键操作环节，参与优化编辑体验与操作效率；\n3、协助设计与研发团队推进需求落地，跟进基础产品功能的开发与测试；\n4、通过用户反馈、数据与内容案例，协助发现剪辑链路中的体验问题与优化机会；\n5、在真实内容创作场景（如航拍/运动/日常视频）中体验产品，输出使用反馈。","requirement":"1、统招本科及以上，对产品经理岗位有明确兴趣；\n2、具备基础表达与文档能力，能完成需求整理与逻辑表达；\n3、使用过剪辑 / 影像 / 图像类工具，了解基础剪辑流程，对工具类产品的易用性、效率与体验有基本认知；\n4、对航拍 / 无人机 / 运动相机等有兴趣或使用经验者优先，有短视频或Vlog内容创作经历者加分；\n5、了解或使用过AI剪辑 / AIGC内容工具，对AI辅助剪辑能力有兴趣或实践经验者优先。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1784285255116,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7663444194439104811","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}